       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Improved feedback on hits and blocks during combat.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixes in the buffer of the attacks that improve the feeling when doing the pierce attack",
